# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_THETM01_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: The value of sine(theta_max)/wavelength is less than 0.550
RESPONSE:The crystals diffract weakly at high angle and are unstable
 during data collection, therefore we were unable to collect a full 
 dataset
;
_vrf_PLAT029_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: _diffrn_measured_fraction_theta_full value Low .      0.623 Why?  
RESPONSE:The crystals are unstable in data collection conditions, therefore
 it was not possible to collect a full data set. 
;
_vrf_PLAT201_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Isotropic non-H Atoms in Main Residue(s) .......         59 Report
RESPONSE:there is a 3rd component (33%) of the crystal we were not able to
 index, in addition to the two twin components that were index.
;
_vrf_PLAT971_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Check Calcd Resid. Dens.  0.83A   From O12             3.66 eA-3  
RESPONSE:there is a 3rd component (33%) of the crystal we were not able to
 index, in addition to the two twin components that were index.d
;
# end Validation Reply Form

# start Validation Reply Form
_vrf_PLAT084_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: High wR2 Value (i.e. > 0.25) ...................       0.36 Report
RESPONSE:More refinement was not possible because of the low-quality 
dataset and unstable crystal.
;
_vrf_PLAT306_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Isolated Oxygen Atom (H-atoms Missing ?) .......        O1W Check 
RESPONSE:Hydrogen atoms were not assigned due to disordered Oxygen atom.
;
_vrf_PLAT315_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Singly Bonded Carbon Detected (H-atoms Missing).        C16 Check 
RESPONSE:Hydrogen atoms were not assigned because of the low-quality 
dataset and disordered cytosine ligand. 
;
_vrf_PLAT342_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Low Bond Precision on  C-C Bonds ...............      0.091 Ang.  
RESPONSE:Disordered cytosine ligand caused this short and 
long band length.    
;
_vrf_PLAT430_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Short Inter D...A Contact  O1       ..O1W      .       2.76 Ang.  
RESPONSE:Disordered free water molecules in the structure caused this 
short interaction. 
;
_vrf_PLAT911_Ag6_Nb10            
;
PROBLEM: Missing FCF Refl Between Thmin & STh/L=    0.511       1938 Report
RESPONSE: ...
;
# end Validation Reply Form

